{"title":"2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The seven numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/7/1f7671817f1dcffbfe738157f2d829a6dbd95ff4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 2, 5, 10, 25, 50, 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"159\" height=\"17\" /> repeat to form the following pattern:\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/5/0a56e53028c7834c1e21dbeac73253a1a515b5b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,2,5,10,25,50,100,1,2,5,10,25,50,100,\\ldots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"354\" height=\"17\" /></center>\n<p>What is the sum of the 18<sup>th</sup> number and the 75<sup>th</sup> number in the sequence?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9863efc4dfaef32e6821179ea531a8fd8f82413b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 110 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 11 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 27 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 7 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Slow.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Slow)\">Solution 1 (Slow)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Slow)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Listing the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7e4c2930d79c57bee209557767b878cd704ea46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> numbers of the sequence, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/4/a34ce172d4b303407631e95f186ebdbf355d841c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 2, 5, 10, 25, 50, 100, 1, 2, 5, 10, 25, 50, 100, 1, 2, 5, 10, 25, 50, 100, 1, 2, 5, 10, 25, 50, 100, 1, 2, 5, 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"734\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/d/61d228833c0a92b5f3ab95e877a0924dea100886.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25, 50, 100, 1, 2, 5, 10, 25, 50, 100, 1, 2, 5, 10, 25, 50, 100, 1, 2, 5, 10, 25, 50, 100, 1, 2, 5, 10, 25, 50, 100, 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"761\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/4/0b48b7eb3f867bbff4d0babeb8551283e91779b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2, 5, 10, 25, 50, 100, 1, 2, 5, 10, 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"246\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>From this list, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /><sup>th</sup> integer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7e4c2930d79c57bee209557767b878cd704ea46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /><sup>th</sup> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. The sum of these numbers is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/6/d663774d7c40a7f4c1b0ee86efdfaadf3d02c91e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 + 25 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(E) } 35}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"148\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Faster.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Faster)\">Solution 2 (Faster)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Faster)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> numbers that repeat, we can find the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /><sup>th</sup> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7e4c2930d79c57bee209557767b878cd704ea46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /><sup>th</sup> integers by finding the remainders when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7e4c2930d79c57bee209557767b878cd704ea46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> are divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820a20de2847dfdc1bc5cffc8d904933150032bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /><sup>th</sup> integer is the same as the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /><sup>th</sup> integer, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7e4c2930d79c57bee209557767b878cd704ea46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa94edfb9739dcc66dad90f7dd5c148f44a57e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7e4c2930d79c57bee209557767b878cd704ea46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /><sup>th</sup> integer is the same as the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /><sup>th</sup> integer, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Like in solution 1, the sum of these integers is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/8/8784cbd649a19478d5714254a1a689dce0438fee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(E) } 35}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"65\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center